WEBVTT

00:47:28.324 --> 00:47:30.705
to remove the routine jobs

00:47:30.729 --> 00:47:33.435
so we can focus on,

00:47:33.459 --> 00:47:36.443
and have our children
and grandchildren focus on,

00:47:36.467 --> 00:47:37.910
the creative jobs,

00:47:37.934 --> 00:47:40.704
the empathetic jobs,
the compassionate jobs,

00:47:40.728 --> 00:47:45.371
the jobs with complexity
and depth and creativity."

00:47:45.395 --> 00:47:49.141
And we can start to finally realize

00:47:49.165 --> 00:47:54.069
that we are not on Earth
just to repetitively do work,

00:47:54.093 --> 00:47:59.963
and that we should think about
things that we love to do, our passion,

00:47:59.987 --> 00:48:02.045
and what it means to be human.